sequenceDiagram
    participant EP   as EnerPlanET Backend
    participant GW_B as BUEM Gateway (/buem/start)
    participant BM   as BUEM Flask (:5000)
    participant VOL  as Shared Volume<br>({model_id}/)
    participant GW_C as Calliope Gateway (/calliope/start)
    participant CAL  as Calliope CLI

    rect rgb(176, 186, 207)
        Note over EP,VOL: Phase 1 — Thermal demand  (BUEM must complete before grid simulation)
        EP->>GW_B: POST /buem/start<br>config.json (model_id + topology with buem blocks)

        Note over GW_B: Parse topology<br>Find BasePOI nodes where<br>properties.buem ≠ null<br>Deduplicate by node ID

        par goroutine per building (max BUEM_WORKERS concurrent)
            GW_B->>BM: POST /api/process?include_timeseries=true<br>GeoJSON FeatureCollection (1 feature, model_id included)
            BM-->>GW_B: GeoJSON response<br>properties.buem.thermal_load_profile<br>+ embedded hourly arrays (heating, cooling, electricity)
            GW_B->>VOL: write heating_{lat}_{lon}_{year}.csv
            GW_B->>VOL: write cooling_{lat}_{lon}_{year}.csv
            GW_B->>VOL: write electricity_{lat}_{lon}_{year}.csv
        end

        Note over GW_B: Merge enriched buem blocks back<br>Inject CSV file paths (timeseries arrays retained)
        GW_B-->>EP: enriched config.json<br>(heating_file, cooling_file, electricity_file added)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 246, 247)
        Note over EP,CAL: Phase 2 — Grid optimisation  (consumes BUEM output from shared volume)
        EP->>GW_C: POST /calliope/start  —  enriched config.json
        Note over GW_C: Generate locations.yaml<br>Demand CSV paths from buem.thermal_load_profile<br>link directly to files written in Phase 1
        GW_C->>CAL: bash calliope.sh
        CAL->>VOL: reads heating / cooling / electricity CSVs
        CAL-->>GW_C: optimisation results
        GW_C-->>EP: grid simulation results
    end
